OL,3,AAudio reveals exchanges between control
OL,4,Acentre and drivers before deadly Spain
OL,5,Atrain crash
OL,6,
OL,7,FAudio recordings published in Spanish
OL,8,Fmedia reveal conversations between
OL,9,Ftrain drivers and a railway control
OL,10,Fcentre in the minutes leading up to a
OL,11,Fdeadly train crash that killed at least
OL,12,F69 people and injured dozens.
OL,14,FOfficials are investigating the cause
OL,15,Fof the disaster, which occurred when a
OL,16,Ftrain travelling from Madrid to Seville
OL,17,Fbarrelled into a stationary train on
OL,18,FWednesday morning.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
