OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAudio reveals exchanges between control
OL,4,Acentre and drivers before deadly Spain
OL,5,Atrain crash
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree audio recordings between the
OL,8,Fcontrol centre in Madrid and two train
OL,9,Fdrivers appear to show that one
OL,10,Fhigh-speed train was given clearance to
OL,11,Fmove even though another some 25km (15
OL,12,Fmiles) up ahead had stalled.
OL,14,FPrime Minister Pedro Sanchez, who
OL,15,Ftravelled to the area of the crash,
OL,16,Fsaid authorities were working "day and
OL,17,Fnight" to "get to the bottom of every
OL,18,Flast detail of this tragedy".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
